    "detailed_description": "Five young female ninjas are trapped in an endless time loop. Become the strongest among them and seize the opportunity to challenge the Demon Lords.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.webm?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.mp4?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Acquire a wealth of ninjutsu, taijutsu, and genjutsu to defeat your enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.webm?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.mp4?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Uncover the conspiracy of the Demon Lords and determine the final fate of the ninjas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/ab1ddb598dc2c29de51c6af312c5f121.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/ab1ddb598dc2c29de51c6af312c5f121.webm?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/ab1ddb598dc2c29de51c6af312c5f121.mp4?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Five young female ninjas are trapped in an endless time loop. Become the strongest among them and seize the opportunity to challenge the Demon Lords.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.webm?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/273469cc31c46e8802d15736d7459479.mp4?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Acquire a wealth of ninjutsu, taijutsu, and genjutsu to defeat your enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.webm?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/9d06481fe2cb446585b3cd3f465026fc.mp4?t=1754818618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Uncover the conspiracy of the Demon Lords and determine the final fate of the ninjas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/ab1ddb598dc2c29de51c6af312c5f121.poster.avif?t=1754818618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721280/extras/ab1ddb598dc2c29de51c6af312c5f121.webm?t=175481861